# v1.0.x ignores unknown options (F6).
-- options --
mydumper-version: v1.0.5-1
-- input.cnf --
[mydumper]
load-data=1
threadz=4
-- diagnostics --
2:1-2:10 error MDL401[unknown-option] `load-data` is not a mydumper option in v1.0.5-1: --load-data was removed after v0.21.4-1; the target is v1.0.5-1
  = mydumper ignores it silently: this version skips unknown options, so the setting has no effect.
3:1-3:8 error MDL401[unknown-option] `threadz` is not a mydumper option in v1.0.5-1: did you mean `threads`?
  = mydumper ignores it silently: this version skips unknown options, so the setting has no effect.
